    "The Batangas Bay poster crosswalk records nine unconflicted CoL XR species-name matches and one held poster-versus-abstract spelling conflict; these are not independent field identifications, locality assignments, or public species assertions.",
    "The October 30 CC BY fish-checklist batch records 16 historical Ragay Gulf/Ragay Bay type-material treatments and 25 locality groups. A later locality crosswalk anchors only Pasacao, Siburio Point, and Alibijaban Island at place-name context; it transfers no coordinates, does not assign the whole gulf, and adds no CALABARZON species assertion or public row.",
